+# Data Model: Docker Auto-Update
+
+**Date**: 2026-03-31  
+**Status**: Draft
+
+## Entities
+
+### UpdateConfig
+
+Configuration entity for auto-update behavior.
+
+| Field | Type | Default | Description |
+|-------|------|---------|-------------|
+| enabled | boolean | true | Enable/disable auto-update |
+| branch | string | "master" | Git branch to track |
+| checkInterval | number | 0 | Periodic check interval in seconds (0=only at startup) |
+| gitUrl | string | - | Git repository URL |
+| gitToken | string | - | HTTPS token for authentication |
+| sshKeyPath | string | "/root/.ssh/id_rsa" | SSH key path |
+| maxRetries | number | 3 | Maximum retry attempts on failure |
+| backupEnabled | boolean | true | Enable backup of last known good build |
+
+### UpdateStatus
+
+Runtime status tracking for update operations.
+
+| Field | Type | Description |
+|-------|------|-------------|
+| lastCheckTime | ISO8601 | Timestamp of last update check |
+| lastSuccessfulUpdate | ISO8601 | Timestamp of last successful update |
+| currentCommit | string | Current deployed commit hash |
+| remoteCommit | string | Latest commit hash from remote |
+| updateInProgress | boolean | Whether an update is currently running |
+| consecutiveFailures | number | Count of consecutive update failures |
+| status | enum | Current status: idle, checking, updating, failed, success |
+
+### BuildArtifact
+
+Information about a compiled build.
+
+| Field | Type | Description |
+|-------|------|-------------|
+| commitHash | string | Git commit hash this build was created from |
+| buildTime | ISO8601 | Timestamp when build was created |
+| path | string | Path to build artifacts (e.g., /app/dist) |
+| size | number | Total size of build artifacts in bytes |
+| checksum | string | SHA256 checksum of build artifacts |
+| isValid | boolean | Whether this build passed validation |
+
+## State Transitions
+
+### Update Process State Machine
+
+```
+                    ┌─────────┐
+         ┌─────────│  IDLE   │◄──────────────────┐
+         │         └────┬────┘                   │
+         │              │ check triggered      │
+         │              ▼                      │
+         │         ┌──────────┐   no updates    │
+         │         │ CHECKING │─────────────────┘
+         │         └────┬─────┘
+         │              │ updates found
+         │              ▼
+         │         ┌──────────┐
+         └────────►│ UPDATING │
+         rollback  └────┬─────┘
+                      │ build success
+                      ▼
+              ┌──────────────┐
+              │    SUCCESS   │◄────────────────┐
+              └──────┬───────┘                 │
+                     │ start service          │
+                     ▼                        │ restart/update
+              ┌──────────────┐                │
+              │   RUNNING    │────────────────┘
+              └──────────────┘
+
+              ┌──────────────┐
+              │    FAILED    │
+              └──────────────┘
+```
+
+## Validation Rules
+
+### UpdateConfig Validation
+
+- `enabled` must be boolean
+- `branch` must be non-empty string, max 255 chars
+- `checkInterval` must be non-negative integer, 0 or >= 60 (minimum 1 minute)
+- `gitUrl` must be valid Git URL format (https:// or git@)
+- `sshKeyPath` must be absolute path if provided
+- `maxRetries` must be positive integer, max 10
+
+### UpdateStatus Validation
+
+- `lastCheckTime` and `lastSuccessfulUpdate` must be valid ISO8601 timestamps
+- `currentCommit` and `remoteCommit` must be valid 40-char hex SHA
+- `consecutiveFailures` must be non-negative integer
+- `status` must be one of: idle, checking, updating, failed, success
+
+### BuildArtifact Validation
+
+- `commitHash` must be valid 40-char hex SHA
+- `buildTime` must be valid ISO8601 timestamp
+- `path` must be absolute path within /app
+- `size` must be non-negative integer
+- `checksum` must be valid 64-char hex SHA256
+
+## Persistence
+
+### Update Status File
+
+```
+/data/update-status.json
+```
+
+Stores the current UpdateStatus entity. Written atomically using write-to-temp-then-rename pattern.
+
+### Build History
+
+```
+/data/builds/
+├── current -> /data/builds/build-20260331-104500-ab12cd34
+├── build-20260331-104500-ab12cd34/
+│   ├── dist/          # Compiled artifacts
+│   ├── meta.json      # BuildArtifact data
+│   └── manifest.txt   # File listing with checksums
+└── build-20260331-094200-ef56gh78/
+    └── ...
+```
+
+### Configuration
+
+All configuration via environment variables (no separate config file for auto-update). See UpdateConfig entity for complete list.
+
